  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the man's strained, confused facial expression represents the humorous and self-mocking idea of striving to be 'a real life picasso painting'. The meme uses the man's expression as a visual metaphor for the user's own potential aesthetic failure or artistic ineptitude, creating an identification with the depicted person. The text 'when you strive to be' directly addresses the user, inviting them to identify with the scenario.",
